= MauvilleCity_Gym_EventScript_Angelo
trainerbattle_single TRAINER_ANGELO MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_AngeloIntro MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_AngeloDefeat
msgbox	MAUVILLE GYM's WATTSON has a shiny forehead. It makes me happy!
end
= MauvilleCity_Gym_EventScript_GymGuide
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_DEFEATED_MAUVILLE_GYM MauvilleCity_Gym_EventScript_GymGuidePostVictory
msgbox	Hey, how's it going, CHAMPION- bound PLAYER?WATTSON, the LEADER of MAUVILLE GYM, uses ELECTRIC-type POKéMON.If you challenge him with WATER-type POKéMON, he'll zap them! Bzzt!And, he's put in switch-controlled doors all over his GYM! Eccentric!Hey, go for it!
release
end
= MauvilleCity_Gym_EventScript_GymGuidePostVictory
msgbox	Whoa, you're electrifying! You've powered the door open!
release
end
= MauvilleCity_Gym_EventScript_Kirk
